OL,3,GNEWSANew Tiger mural celebrates Hull
OL,4,ACity's success
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans coming to games at Hull
OL,7,FCity will be greeted by a mural which
OL,8,Fhas been painted on the wall of a pub
OL,9,Fnear the city's railway station.
OL,11,FThe artwork, on the side of the Tigers
OL,12,FLair, depicts a tiger and its cub
OL,13,Falongside the club's former ground.
OL,15,FArtist Steve Dixon, also known as SD
OL,16,FArt, said the mural was inspired by
OL,17,Ffamilies who have attended games
OL,18,Ftogether over the years, including him
OL,19,Fand his nephew.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
