OL,3,GNEWSANew Tiger mural celebrates Hull
OL,4,ACity's success
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It meant a lot to paint. I obviously
OL,7,Flove painting tigers as well, but it
OL,8,Fmeans more," he said.
